   "translations: English 'stood in business' is a nonsensical calque and does not match the intended meaning. Russian 'задержались в бизнесе' and Ukrainian 'стояли в бізнесі' are also incorrect translations of the intended meaning.",
   "The Danish sentence 'Vi stod i forretning i en time for at få billetter' is nonsensical because 'stå i forretning' does not mean 'stand in line'. The English translation 'stood in business' is incorrect and does not match the intended meaning. The Russian translation 'задержались в бизнесе' is incorrect. The Ukrainian translation 'стояли в бізнесі' is incorrect."
  ]
 },
